    <string name="ingame_touch_help">Touch Controls: They appear when no controller is detected, use checkbox to manually enable it; a tap on the screen shows them too, until a controller is used. The menu-icon opens the configuration (MENU = SELECT). Latch L and R: a tap keeps L or R pressed until the next tap (aim and fire with two thumbs).</string>
