    <string name="ingame_latch">Latch L and R (Touch)</string>
    <string name="ingame_alternate_help">Alternate Controls: L1 = Knife, L2 = Aim (aim with the right stick), R1 = Inventory (Weapons/Recovery), R2 = Fire / use the knife, Y = Map. A, B, X (Ashley) and START as before.</string>

